00:23:28.260 --> 00:23:32.190
So that agent, the support agent
is running as a hosted agent

00:23:32.190 --> 00:23:34.380
within Microsoft Foundry.

00:23:34.380 --> 00:23:39.120
These are agents that you build
with custom code that you build

00:23:39.120 --> 00:23:44.730
in any framework that you want,
including GitHub Copilot SDK,

00:23:44.730 --> 00:23:50.130
LangChain, LangGraph, or
the Claude agent SDK.

00:23:50.130 --> 00:23:54.330
You build your agent, starting
on your local machine,

00:23:54.330 --> 00:23:59.220
make sure it's working
correctly, and then you can move

00:23:59.220 --> 00:24:02.610
that application up
into the cloud sandbox,

00:24:02.610 --> 00:24:05.850
hosted in Foundry Agent Service.

00:24:05.850 --> 00:24:09.090
What's great about
running your agents

00:24:09.090 --> 00:24:13.860
in the Foundry Agent
Service hosted agent,

00:24:13.860 --> 00:24:19.470
is that that sandbox is
automatically secured and set

00:24:19.470 --> 00:24:21.900
up with the authentication
