00:24:21.900 --> 00:24:27.720
to access Foundry resources,
like calling Claude models

00:24:27.720 --> 00:24:32.010
in Microsoft Foundry
for the agent to use

00:24:32.010 --> 00:24:35.250
in doing its reasoning
and operation.

00:24:35.250 --> 00:24:39.960
And also, the hosted agent
service facilitates the

00:24:39.960 --> 00:24:45.660
authentication that you need to
connect to the tools and MCPs

00:24:45.660 --> 00:24:52.470
that host your enterprise data
